  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partner Identification: Democratic dialogue project in Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Silba is applying for funding to complete a Partner Identification trip to Georgia involving 3 Silba members. We are planning to meet three potential partners in Tbilisi during a 5 day visit, with 2 travel days. The project programme includes three full workshop days with the potential partners (see Annex 3). The aim of the Partner Identification is to establish a successful foundation for an equal, sustainable and long-term partnership within the theme of democratic dialogue, where the visions and capacities of Silba and our partner(s) align.</narrative>
  </description>
